  "expectation": "Review when the authored name is a single character that is neither a letter nor a digit\n(\"×\", \"☰\", \"✕\"): a screen reader reads \"times\" or nothing. 4.1.2 requires a name, not a good one,\nso never a violation. One-character names that are letters (also non-ASCII, \"Ä\") or digits pass, and\na symbol that comes from content rather than an attribute is not this id. Hidden subtrees are out of\nscope.",
